  <item>
    <title>#2 育碧重返Steam，该聊聊游戏平台与分成了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637d3190f6753f4e9d4d556f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637d3190f6753f4e9d4d556f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Nov 2022 20:31:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>11月22日上午，育碧悄无声息在Steam上架了《刺客信条：英灵殿》，并与外媒确认，将会在稍后陆续推出《纪元1800》和《冠军冲刺》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为众多从Steam出走厂商中的一员，育碧最初究竟为何离去，又为何在现在回归？或许是时候该聊聊游戏平台与分成了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听《游戏指向标》，我们是一群游戏从业者，或许能从您从未思考过的角度出发，分析游戏行业内外的大小事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 《刺客信条：英灵殿》主题曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 育碧悄无声息重返Steam</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 对于育碧重返Steam后的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 育碧回归前的蛛丝马迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 为何育碧从Steam出走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 这两年的育碧过得还好吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 此次回归的目的是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1378">22:58</a> 大家都想做游戏平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> Epic带动其他平台降低分成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 抛弃Origin，拥抱Steam的EA</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 从开发者角度，聊游戏平台和分成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> Epic的烧钱模式还有竞争力吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3222">53:42</a> 依旧活着的GOG</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3492">58:12</a> 下一个入局者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">01:00:20</a> 《Still Alive》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhouJ-alq57Mf6bIlZvFg6DNCgF5.m4a" length="53585997" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvTldrRUdmZkNxdHk1blNWc3pIQzB2ZjA0dkUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
